     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

354 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My name is Olika Nikolska\056 I\031m a Ukrainian illustrator based in Odesa\054 with a background that includes four years at a mobile game studio and years of freelance work spanning books\054 stickers\054 portraits\054 and brand illustration\056\n\nOutside of work\054 I\031m a matcha and cocoa person with a real weakness for tiramisu and anything with cinnamon or strawberry\056 I also have a soft spot for collectible figures and building sets\024my shelves will confirm that\056 I love sketching in a paper sketchbook and sharing my space with a cat\054 whom I also walk on a leash\056 He stops at every flower and leaf like it\031s the most important thing in the world\054 and honestly\054 he\031s not wrong\056 A good series\054 a YouTube video\054 or a TikTok rabbit hole can easily take over my evening\056 Home is where I feel most at ease\054 which is probably why I do my best work there\056\n\nLiving in Odesa means life comes with surprises\054 and not always pleasant ones\056 But believing in better days and good endings is what keeps me drawing\056\n)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 355 0 R
     /Pg 346 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

